 profile should run tests with the test profile by default https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/3149\r\n- [x] The profile a runner or native image is built from should be the default profile used unless overridden at runtime by quarkus.profile https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/3147\r\n- [X] Document that running the test suite under a custom test profile is done via Maven and Gradle https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/3146\r\n- [x] Native executable tests should be run under the test profile https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/3148\r\n\r\nBackground info https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=footer#!msg/quarkus-dev/NFpDtpRVZ7Y/3G7WmRMJDAAJ","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/3150/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/3150/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/comments/509806545","html_url":"https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/3148#issuecomment-509806545","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/3148","id":509806545,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUwOTgwNjU0NQ==","user":{"login":"machi1990","id":10106536,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA2NTM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10106536?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/machi1990","html_url":"https://github.com/machi1990","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/machi1990/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/machi1990/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/machi1990/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/machi1990/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/machi1990/subscriptions","organizations